# MiniLife Cursor Rules
- Project: MiniLife (2D Isometric Sandbox Survival RPG: Kenshi meets RimWorld meets Minecraft)
- Engine: Godot 4.x
- Language: GDScript with strict static typing
- Single Source of Truth: PROJECT_MiniLife.md
- Systems communication: Exclusively via autoloads/signal_bus.gd
- Isometric Depth: y_sort_enabled = true from Day 1
- Chunks: 16x16 delta-save from seed
- Simulation Bubble: 3-tier LOD (<50 tiles: frame, 50-100: 5s, >100: 30s)
- Zero Emojis: Strictly forbidden in code, logs, comments, and commits
- Workflow: Verification -> Journal (journal/YYYY-MM-DD/minilife.md) -> Git push
